@startuml
title DataPipe - Diagramme de Contexte
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Utilisateur Metier" as User
actor "Administrateur" as Admin
actor "Systeme Externe\n(emetteur webhook)" as External

rectangle "DataPipe API\n(Flask + JWT + SQLAlchemy)" as DataPipe
database "SQLite\n(datapipe.db)" as DB
folder "Fichiers locaux\nuploads/" as FS
cloud "Services IA\n(OpenAI / Anthropic / OpenRouter)" as AI
cloud "Sources externes\n(DB/API via Datasource)" as Sources

User --> DataPipe : Utilise endpoints REST
Admin --> DataPipe : Configure orgs,\nroles, integrations
External --> DataPipe : POST inbound webhook

DataPipe --> DB : Persiste metadonnees\net etats
DataPipe --> FS : Lit/ecrit fichiers\net resultats
DataPipe --> AI : Generation IA\n(SQL, suggestions, chat)
DataPipe --> Sources : Requetes datasource\net appels HTTP

note bottom of DataPipe
API versionnee sous /api/v1
Modules: auth, orgs, pipelines, nodes,
runs, files, transform, ai, results,
scheduling, webhooks, notifications,
analytics, api-keys, health
end note

@enduml
